Description: OpenRGB with Razer Huntsman V3 Pro TKL support on Linux
 OpenRGB controls RGB lighting. This build adds a libusb path for the
 control interface of the Razer Huntsman V3 Pro TKL, which the official
 OpenRGB cannot reach on Linux. It replaces the official openrgb package.
